-suite-2-dreams-of-the-second-age-impressions?p=1328617#post1328617\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But not actually free, free.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's weird, I actually did get it for free but now there is indeed a price on it. I know I didn't back the Core Book Kickstarter, and I don't remember the suite being a reward for the DB or Lunar KS, so I have no idea what happened there <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-31T15:28:11-07:00","id":1328624,"title":"","content":"It was free when I clicked it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-31T15:31:27-07:00","id":1328626,"title":"","content":"Hmm maybe someone messed up and forgot to put the price on it at first?<br /> <br /> Anyways back on topic - while not all of the tracks do it for me most are pretty great. My favorites are the darker ones - Into the Shadowlands, The Demon City, and Limit Break","signature":"","edite